#X obj 250 1053 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1053 @knee;
#X text 270 1053 A gradual increase in gain reduction around the threshold:
below thresh-(knee/2) there is no gain reduction \, above thresh+(knee/2)
there is the same gain reduction as without a knee \, and in between
there is a gradual increase in gain reduction. Тип: float. Единицы:
'db'. Значение по умолчанию: 3\. Диапазон: 0\...6\.;
#X obj 250 1156 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1156 @link;
#X text 270 1156 The amount of linkage between the channels: 0 = each
channel is independent \, 1 = all channels have the same amount of
gain reduction. Тип: float. Значение по умолчанию: 1\. Диапазон: 0\...1\.;
#X obj 250 1228 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1228 @refresh;
